{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.verbatimLine\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cursor</span>.<span class=\"name\">verbatimLine</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor\">Cursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.VerbatimLine\">VerbatimLine</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The rest of the line as a line of verbatim block content.\n\nA partly consumed tab at the cursor is excluded from the source, with its remaining columns becoming\nthe line's leading spaces.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.verbatimLine","kind":"def","line":109,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Cursor.verbatimLine","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.lean#L109-L119"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.isBlank\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cursor</span>.<span class=\"name\">isBlank</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"