an> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Advances the cursor over the longest prefix of characters that satisfy `pred`, returning the\nresulting cursor and the number of characters that it consumes.\n\nThe column is incremented by the consumed count, which is correct only when `pred` rejects the tab\ncharacter (each matched char then advances the column by exactly one). For tab-aware whitespace\nskipping use `countIndentCols` or `consumeIndentCapped`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.advanceWhile","kind":"def","line":86,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Cursor.advanceWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.lean#L86-L102"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.next\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cursor</span>.<span class=\"name\">next</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor\">Cursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor\">Cursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The cursor advanced by one character, or is unchanged at the end of the line.\n\nThe column advances by one, which is correct for every character but a tab. For tabs use\n`countIndentCols` or `consumeIndentCapped`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.next","kind":"def","line":72,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Cursor.next","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.lean#L72-L84"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.front?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cursor</span>.<span class=\"name\">front?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor\">Cursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The character at the cursor, if the cursor is not at the end of the line.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.front?","kind":"def","line":68,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Cursor.front?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.lean#L68-L70"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor.intoTab\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cursor</span>.