rsor.lean#L25-L44"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cursor</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A position within a single source line, together with the line's end and the visual column of the\nposition.\n\nThe pair `(pos, col)` is the parser's working position. They are kept in sync by the column-aware\nadvancement primitives below. Direct field updates should preserve the invariant that `col` is the\nvisual column of `pos`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.html#Lean.Markdown.Cursor","kind":"structure","line":25,"name":"Lean.Markdown.Cursor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Cursor.lean#L25-L44"}}],"imports":["Init.While","Lean.Data.Markdown.Block"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.Cursor"}